WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:00.898
(audience cheering)

00:00:00.898 --> 00:00:04.177
- So it's been 30 years
since Billboard ranked

00:00:04.177 --> 00:00:06.340
"Hold On" Song of the Year.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.400
Was there a time in your life

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.750
that you was kind of exactly on point

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.410
you needed to hear that message?

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.420
- Oh yeah, yeah.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.069
- [All] Yeah.

00:00:15.069 --> 00:00:15.902
- Oh yeah.
- You think so?

00:00:15.902 --> 00:00:18.670
- No, I was really in a dark, dark space

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.170
when that lyric was written.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.560
I was really at a point in my life

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:24.400
where I felt like,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.860
I was at a crossroads and I really felt,

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.620
if I didn't get my life together

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.600
and stop do drugs

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.990
and I had a really bad
boyfriend at the time

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.810
and I just was in a lot of pain

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:42.040
and I just said if I
don't change my course,

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.560
I'm gonna be in a lot of trouble.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.540
So I knew that I was at a crossroads

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.440
and that I either had to
hold on for one more day

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.140
or just die.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:50.160
- [Kelly] Can I thank you
for being honest about that?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:51.820
- Yeah, yeah.
- 'Cause not everybody

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.479
is honest about that.
- Yes.

00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:56.460
(audience applauding)
- I'm sober 15 years.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:00.410
I was gonna say, I need it now,
in this world, in this time.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.550
You need inspiration like this

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.104
and songs that can help
get you through it.

00:01:05.104 --> 00:01:06.523
- Music heals.
- So I need it now.

00:01:06.523 --> 00:01:08.612
- I believe music heals, yes.
- Music heals, it's true.

